            'authors.sec4.h3a.li4': 'Submit for editorial review. You will receive a confirmation email from the journal\'s submission system.',
            'authors.sec4.h3b': 'Initial editorial review',
            'authors.sec4.h3b.p': 'After submission, an editor will assess whether the manuscript is within scope and meets minimum policy requirements. Manuscripts that do not meet these requirements may be desk-rejected at this stage.',
            'authors.sec5.h3a': 'What to expect during review',
            'authors.sec5.h3a.li1': 'After editorial acceptance for review, your manuscript will be sent to independent reviewers with relevant expertise.',
            'authors.sec5.h3a.li2': 'Reviewers are expected to provide objective, evidence-based assessments in accordance with the <a href="publication-ethics.html">publication ethics policy</a>.',
            'authors.sec5.h3a.li3': 'Review timelines vary by journal and by the availability of reviewers in the relevant field.',
